epics.body:
Production rollout of `nerve-agent` without a repository checkout on each endpoint. Core runs on a server that only IT administrators can reach, and endpoints get the agent from Core:

- a one-line PowerShell install for single machines;
- reusable, revocable deployment keys with operator approval;
- a signed MSI for GPO, Intune or SCCM.

Builds on signed releases (K-7). Remote updates (K-19) come after. PR #73 (K-20) stays the interim path for test and single-machine installs from a local artifact folder.
